603b962d606b8e8.avif?t=1786044683 width=800 height=65 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're looking for answers or simply trying to survive, finding the way forward is up to you, there is nobody here to guide you. Scavenge for resources, solve puzzles, and explore a variety of detailed environments. Pay attention to your surroundings as you begin to piece together the the horrific story, discover horrors beyond comprehension, and grow to understand that sometimes things are best left undisturbed. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640820/extras/f16e7f2c7af4af8ecfe4f1b6ea8b37cb.poster.avif?t=1786044683\" width=1000 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640820/extras/f16e7f2c7af4af8ecfe4f1b6ea8b37cb.webm?t=1786044683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640820/extras/f16e7f2c7af4af8ecfe4f1b6ea8b37cb.mp4?t=1786044683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640820/extras/8d4e4e3394f2033e2cd3e0cb5a0fbccc.avif?t=1786044683\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640820/extras_big/8d4e4e3394f2033e2cd3e0cb5a0fbccc.avif?t=1786044683 width=800 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every action is a new decision, consider the consequences and prepare to live with them. Think in the moment, decide your loadout and pick your approach to combat. Understanding the risk and reward of every choice is essential for your survival. Do you dig deeper and push on to uncover the mysteries beneath you, or are you just trying to escape and survive to see tomorrow? The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640820/extras/82bf47aff644374c2dcf7108c02fbf6a.poster.avif?t=1786044683\" width=1000 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640820/extras/82bf47aff644374c2dcf7108c02fbf6a.webm?t=1786044683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640820/extras/82bf47aff644374c2dcf7108c02fbf6a.mp4?t=1786044683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Classic survival horror for the modern age. Investigate a mysterious numbers station and its connection to the disappearance of a loved one. Explore depths forgotten by time, and uncover why some things should stay buried.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640820/9c0f11673c54d4a3141e0f4bd06f7c72099ba7c5/header.jpg?t=1786044683", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640820/82ebbd8b66bab7cc8d30605bee15e403019904e9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786044683", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640820/82ebbd8b66bab7cc8d30605bee15e403019904e9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786044683", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i3 7th gen or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 1050<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 13th gen<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia RTX 3060<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Travis O"], "publishers": ["Travis O"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}, {"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640820/793b1371d9ff1086671a657c439c6a1ab7ccf85c/ss_793b1371d9ff1086671a657c439c6a1ab7ccf85c.600x338.jpg?t=1786044683", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640820/793b1371d9ff1086671a657c439c6a1ab7ccf85c/ss_793b1371d9ff1086671a657c439c6a1ab7ccf85c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786044683"}, {"id": 1, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640820/6b3c5799e0d17fb1432e16e4a15eb26614efdfc4/ss_6b3c5799e0d17fb1432e16e4a15eb26614efdfc4.600x338.jpg?t=1786044683", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640820/6b3c5799e0d17fb1432e16e4a15eb26614efdfc4/ss_6b3c5799e0d17fb1432e16e4a15eb26614efdfc4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786044683"}, {"id": 2, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640820/336ba8c2fca33d38f0b7f358e430f3582a81e698/ss_336ba8c2fca33d38f0b7f358e430f3582a81e698.600x338.jpg?t=1786044683", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640820/336ba8c2fca33d38f0b7f358e430f3582a81e698/ss_336ba8c2fca33d38f0b7f358e430f3582a81e698.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786044683"}, {"id": 3, "path_thumbnail": "https://s